%% Sequence: initiation → plan → accept → orchestrate
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor H as Human
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as Project API
  participant INT as Integration hub
  participant PS as Planning service
  participant LLM as LLM
  participant DB as Durable state
  participant OR as Orchestrator
  participant W as Worker
  participant EXT as External board

  H->>UI: Initiate work (integration / doc / ad-hoc)
  UI->>API: POST WorkRun
  API->>DB: CP1 IntentReceived
  alt Integration run
    API->>INT: Fetch issues (filter)
    INT->>EXT: List/get issues
    EXT-->>INT: Issue payloads
    INT-->>API: Raw items
  else Document / ad-hoc
    API->>DB: Load docs / normalize body
  end
  API->>DB: CP2 SourcesResolved · CP3 Ingested
  API->>PS: Enqueue PlanJob
  API->>DB: CP4 PlanningQueued
  PS->>DB: Read work_items + docs + goal
  PS->>LLM: Decompose / prioritize / criteria
  LLM-->>PS: Structured plan
  PS->>DB: CP5 PlanDraft (WorkPlan vN)
  PS-->>UI: Plan ready for review
  alt Auto-accept policy
    API->>DB: CP6 PlanAccepted
  else Human gate
    H->>UI: Approve / edit plan
    UI->>API: Accept plan
    API->>DB: CP6 PlanAccepted
  end
  Note over OR,DB: Orchestrator is logic-only from here
  loop Every X seconds
    OR->>DB: Reconcile tick
    OR->>DB: CP8 Materialize cards if needed
    OR->>W: Spawn / assign under capacity
    W->>DB: Heartbeat · status · artifacts
    OR->>DB: Stuck detect · kill · retry
    OR->>EXT: Sync mapped statuses
    OR-->>UI: Dashboard / HITL events
  end
  W-->>OR: Done success / fail / blocked
  OR->>DB: CP10 RunTerminal when all done
